Subject: [PATCH 1/1] drivers:ntb : Enable NTB transport layer.

Reprogram BIOS to work with NTB transport layer.
Tweak BIOS such that messaging to work as spad registers.
Re-program BIOS for doorbell registers.
Reflect same changes in NTB transport layer to work.

